PASS  A$<9  (string variable LHS): DE=0, ERRMARK=$DD, FPERR=10
PASS  9=A$  (string variable RHS): DE=0, ERRMARK=$DD, FPERR=10
PASS  A$  (bare string, no relop, in numeric context): DE=0, ERRMARK=$DD, FPERR=10
PASS  "A"="A" leaves ERRMARK/FPERR clear (control)  DE=0xffff ERRMARK=0 FPERR=0
